flowchart TD
  build[npm run build] --> clean[Delete dist and dist-web]
  clean --> serverBuild[build-server]
  serverBuild --> dist[dist/server bundle]
  clean --> webBuild[build-web]
  webBuild --> distWeb[Web static output]
  dist --> bin[bin entry]
  distWeb --> bin
  bin --> pkg[npm package]
  pkg --> publish[npm publish]
